  m_Name: Text_FarmReeve_Shortfall_VennAccept
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Game.Dialogue.TextDialogueNode
  text: Then do it properly. Ask the field gang, Pim and old Gerrit, they work by the barn all day. And if you must talk to Venn, do it by daylight and mind your manners. Bring me something I can hold, not a shadow. Twenty-five coin, counted twice.
